content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Fire Chief",
      "description": "Senior officer who directs strategy and oversees department operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Response Strategy",
      "description": "Planned approach for allocating fire units and handling emergencies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Station",
      "description": "Facility that hosts fire units and resources",
      "attributes": [
        "Fire Unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fire Unit",
      "description": "Team of firefighters assigned to a station or deployment",
      "attributes": [
        "Firefighter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Firefighter",
      "description": "Emergency responder who handles fire suppression and rescue tasks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Incident Report",
      "description": "Record describing details and outcomes of a fire incident"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dispatcher",
      "description": "Operator who receives emergency calls and coordinates deployments"
    },
    {
      "name": "Emergency Call",
      "description": "Incoming report requesting emergency response"
    },
    {
      "name": "Field Messaging",
      "description": "Communication exchanged between dispatcher and firefighters"
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Check",
      "description": "Routine inspection performed to ensure equipment readiness"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fire Truck",
      "description": "Vehicle used to transport firefighters and equipment"
    },
    {
      "name": "Gear",
      "description": "Protective and operational equipment used by firefighters"
    },
    {
      "name": "Training Officer",
      "description": "Specialist responsible for drills, instruction, and skill development"
    },
    {
      "name": "Drill",
      "description": "Training exercise conducted to prepare for emergency scenarios",
      "attributes": [
        "Training Material"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Training Material",
      "description": "Guides, instructions, or resources used in firefighter training"
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Evaluation",
      "description": "Assessment of a firefighter’s skills and training progress"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Training": {
      "objects": [
        "Training Officer",
        "Drill",
        "Training Material",
        "Firefighter",
        "Performance Evaluation"
      ]
    },
    "Deployment": {
      "objects": [
        "Dispatcher",
        "Emergency Call",
        "Fire Unit",
        "Firefighter",
        "Field Messaging"
      ]
    },
    "Supervision": {
      "objects": [
        "Fire Chief",
        "Response Strategy",
        "Station",
        "Fire Unit",
        "Firefighter",
        "Incident Report"
      ]
    },
    "Equipment": {
      "objects": [
        "Safety Check",
        "Fire Truck",
        "Gear"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Also suggest a name change if the meaning of the object is too similar to an object from another bounded context
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Training": {
      "derived from": "Training Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Training Officer",
        "Drill",
        "Training Material",
        "Trainee",
        "Performance Evaluation"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Firefighter -> Trainee"
      ]
    },
    "Deployment": {
      "derived from": "Deployment Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Dispatcher",
        "Emergency Call",
        "Response Unit",
        "Assigned Firefighter",
        "Field Messaging"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Fire Unit -> Response Unit",
        "Firefighter -> Assigned Firefighter"
      ]
    },
    "Supervision": {
      "derived from": "Supervision Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Fire Chief",
        "Response Strategy",
        "Station",
        "Fire Unit",
        "Firefighter",
        "Incident Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Equipment": {
      "derived from": "Equipment Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Safety Check",
        "Fire Truck",
        "Gear"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
